# Build context exclusions for the Linux render image.
#
# The render image needs the source tree and `media/`, but not the artefacts of the macOS
# working copy. Without this the context is ~3.5 GB (worktrees 1.2G + remotion/node_modules
# 1.5G + node_modules 594M + .git 135M), almost all of it either wrong-platform or dead
# weight. node_modules is excluded on purpose: installing inside the image is what produces
# a LINUX `@remotion/compositor-*`; copying the darwin tree across would fail at render time.

.git
.github
worktrees
node_modules
remotion/node_modules
**/node_modules

# Control-plane churn that has no bearing on a render.
state
logs
*.log

# Local scratch and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.bak-*
.colima
